You remain silent.
He sets down his backpack and pulls out water and food.]]
        },
        [6100714] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Here, for you, my poor friend! May the first light over the sacred tower find you awake and well again.\"",
          DialogueId = 6100714,
          GUID = "0F45C264",
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room307_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Here, for you, my poor friend! May the first light over the sacred tower find you awake and well again.\""
        },
        [6100801] = {
          ContentEN = "Two blood-red flowers, entwined at the stem, pulse with an eerie radiance.\nYou raise your lantern — its light spills over strands of faded blonde hair and segments of pallid vertebrae. Is this a Filthoid wearing human skin… or a man on the verge of becoming one?\nYou tense, grip tightening around your weapon — yet it makes no move to strike. Only those crimson eyes, set deep in shadow, watch you in silence.",
          DialogueId = 6100801,
          GUID = "0F45D0AA",
          NextDialogue = 6100802,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Two blood-red flowers, entwined at the stem, pulse with an eerie radiance.\nYou raise your lantern — its light spills over strands of faded blonde hair and segments of pallid vertebrae. Is this a Filthoid wearing human skin… or a man on the verge of becoming one?\nYou tense, grip tightening around your weapon — yet it makes no move to strike. Only those crimson eyes, set deep in shadow, watch you in silence."
        },
        [6100802] = {
          ContentEN = "Suddenly, its throat emits a fractured sound — like jagged stones grinding together, yet pulsing with strange rhythm. Against all reason, you comprehend the meaning—",
          DialogueId = 6100802,
          GUID = "0F45D0D4",
          NextDialogue = 6100803,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Suddenly, its throat emits a fractured sound — like jagged stones grinding together, yet pulsing with strange rhythm. Against all reason, you comprehend the meaning—"
        },
        [6100803] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Please stay a moment, traveler with the lantern. Pray tell, do I still look beautiful in your light?\"",
          DialogueId = 6100803,
          GUID = "0F45D0FE",
          NextDialogue = 6100804,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room308_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Please stay a moment, traveler with the lantern. Pray tell, do I still look beautiful in your light?\""
        },
        [6100804] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"I braided my hair soft and shining, weaving beauty into every strand." Its fingers traced the ruptured flesh at the back of its head.
"I pressed my gown to perfection, adorned it with jewels fit for a queen." Its fingers brushed where crystal spikes tore through the flesh.
"I wear the necklace my lover gave me, to honor his devotion." Its fingers lingered over the jagged bones rising from its throat."]],
          DialogueId = 6100804,
          GUID = "0F45D128",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6100805,
            [2] = 6100808
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room308_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"I braided my hair soft and shining, weaving beauty into every strand." Its fingers traced the ruptured flesh at the back of its head.
"I pressed my gown to perfection, adorned it with jewels fit for a queen." Its fingers brushed where crystal spikes tore through the flesh.
"I wear the necklace my lover gave me, to honor his devotion." Its fingers lingered over the jagged bones rising from its throat."]]
        },
        [6100805] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Yes, you look beautiful.\"",
          DialogueId = 6100805,
          GUID = "0F45D152",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6100806,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "\"Yes, you look beautiful.\""
        },
        [6100806] = {
