Following the sound, you find the old man at a makeshift forge, hammer swinging with vigour. Sparks leap into the campfire's glow as sweat trickles down his brow.]]
        },
        [6102002] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Ah, greetings, young one!" 
The old man calls out with cheerful warmth.]],
          DialogueId = 6102002,
          GUID = "0F4695B4",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102003
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room318_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Ah, greetings, young one!" 
The old man calls out with cheerful warmth.]]
        },
        [6102003] = {
          ContentEN = "Hello.",
          DialogueId = 6102003,
          GUID = "0F4695DE",
          NextDialogue = 6102004,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Hello."
        },
        [6102004] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Looks like you're trapped here too?\" He gestures at himself with a wry smile. \"So am I.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102004,
          GUID = "0F469608",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102005
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room318_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Looks like you're trapped here too?\" He gestures at himself with a wry smile. \"So am I.\""
        },
        [6102005] = {
          ContentEN = "We meet again.",
          DialogueId = 6102005,
          GUID = "0F469632",
          NextDialogue = 6102006,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "We meet again."
        },
        [6102006] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Again? We've met before?\" he asks, puzzled. \"I can't seem to recall... My memory's not what it used to be...\"",
          DialogueId = 6102006,
          GUID = "0F46965C",
          NextDialogue = 6102007,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room318_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Again? We've met before?\" he asks, puzzled. \"I can't seem to recall... My memory's not what it used to be...\""
        },
        [6102007] = {
          ContentEN = "\"It's not safe round here. I've forged a few weapons — feel free to take one.\" \nHe gestures heartily toward his work. \n\"Since I can't find a way out, I thought I'd return to my craft. Who knows — perhaps one day, one of these blades will find its way to a worthy knight, and they might lead us out of this wretched place.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102007,
          GUID = "0F469686",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102008,
            [2] = 6102009,
            [3] = 6102010
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room318_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"It's not safe round here. I've forged a few weapons — feel free to take one.\" \nHe gestures heartily toward his work. \n\"Since I can't find a way out, I thought I'd return to my craft. Who knows — perhaps one day, one of these blades will find its way to a worthy knight, and they might lead us out of this wretched place.\""
        },
        [6102008] = {
          ContentEN = "Choose from the newly forged weapons.",
          DialogueId = 6102008,
          GUID = "0F4696B0",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102011,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Choose from the newly forged weapons."
        },
        [6102009] = {
          ContentEN = "Choose from the neatly arranged finished pieces.",
          DialogueId = 6102009,
          GUID = "0F4696DA",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102011,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Choose from the neatly arranged finished pieces."
        },
        [6102010] = {
          ContentEN = "Choose from the dusty corner of the forge.",
          DialogueId = 6102010,
          GUID = "0F469704",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102011,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Choose from the dusty corner of the forge."
        },
        [6102011] = {
          ContentEN = "With your chosen weapon in hand, you set off once more, the old man's warm farewell echoing behind you.",
          DialogueId = 6102011,
          GUID = "0F46972E",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "With your chosen weapon in hand, you set off once more, the old man's warm farewell echoing behind you."
        },
        [6102101] = {
          ContentEN = [[
The campfire flickers, etching the poet's downcast profile in shifting light.
She half-kneels by the fire, tracing winding patterns in the ash with her fingertip.]],
          DialogueId = 6102101,
          GUID = "0F46A5F2",
          NextDialogue = 6102102,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
The campfire flickers, etching the poet's downcast profile in shifting light.
She half-kneels by the fire, tracing winding patterns in the ash with her fingertip.]]
        },
        [6102102] = {
          ContentEN = "\"If there is nowhere left to run, then embrace your fate.\"\n\"If words cannot become blades to pierce through lies, then let them be bricks with which to build our dreams—\"\nThe poet pauses, lifting her finger slightly.\n\"Hmm...\"",
          DialogueId = 6102102,
          GUID = "0F46A61C",
          NextDialogue = 6102103,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room320_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"If there is nowhere left to run, then embrace your fate.\"\n\"If words cannot become blades to pierce through lies, then let them be bricks with which to build our dreams—\"\nThe poet pauses, lifting her finger slightly.\n\"Hmm...\""
        },
        [6102103] = {
          ContentEN = "A memory stirs within your mind — you are certain you have heard this poem before.\nA wisp of ash brushes your cheek, and almost without thinking, you whisper the missing final line:",
          DialogueId = 6102103,
          GUID = "0F46A646",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102104
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "A memory stirs within your mind — you are certain you have heard this poem before.\nA wisp of ash brushes your cheek, and almost without thinking, you whisper the missing final line:"
        },
        [6102104] = {
          ContentEN = "\"To write a lie, and kindle a flame that never dies.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102104,
          GUID = "0F46A670",
          NextDialogue = 6102105,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "\"To write a lie, and kindle a flame that never dies.\""
        },
        [6102105] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Hmm...!?\" \nThe poet lifts her gaze, astonishment softening into joy. \n\"What a marvellous turn of phrase — just the ending I had longed for! How fortunate, to find a kindred spirit here.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102105,
          GUID = "0F46A69A",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102106
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room320_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Hmm...!?\" \nThe poet lifts her gaze, astonishment softening into joy. \n\"What a marvellous turn of phrase — just the ending I had longed for! How fortunate, to find a kindred spirit here.\""
        },
        [6102106] = {
          ContentEN = "\"It was you who wrote it — in another time.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102106,
          GUID = "0F46A6C4",
          NextDialogue = 6102107,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "\"It was you who wrote it — in another time.\""
        },
        [6102107] = {
          ContentEN = "\"'Another time'...?\" \nAt first she looks surprised, then her eyes brighten, kindled like the firelight itself. \n\"Ah... So you are the one — the heart of this poem. The one I shall meet again, upon another path through time... is that it?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102107,
          GUID = "0F46A6EE",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102108
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room320_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"'Another time'...?\" \nAt first she looks surprised, then her eyes brighten, kindled like the firelight itself. \n\"Ah... So you are the one — the heart of this poem. The one I shall meet again, upon another path through time... is that it?\""
        },
        [6102108] = {
          ContentEN = "Nod.",
          DialogueId = 6102108,
          GUID = "0F46A718",
          NextDialogue = 6102109,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Nod."
        },
        [6102109] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Then tell me — who truly wrote this poem, you or I? Heh... What a beguiling paradox... The Sacred Tree Scholars would be enthralled by such a tale.\"\nThe poet chuckles.\n\"When next we meet, allow me to write you a verse of your own. For now — give me your hand, that I might leave you with my blessing.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102109,
          GUID = "0F46A742",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102110,
            [2] = 6102111
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room320_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Then tell me — who truly wrote this poem, you or I? Heh... What a beguiling paradox... The Sacred Tree Scholars would be enthralled by such a tale.\"\nThe poet chuckles.\n\"When next we meet, allow me to write you a verse of your own. For now — give me your hand, that I might leave you with my blessing.\""
        },
        [6102110] = {
          ContentEN = "Extend your left hand.",
          DialogueId = 6102110,
          GUID = "0F46A76C",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102112,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Extend your left hand."
        },
        [6102111] = {
          ContentEN = "Extend your right hand.",
          DialogueId = 6102111,
          GUID = "0F46A796",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102112,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Extend your right hand."
        },
        [6102112] = {
          ContentEN = "With the last of the ash upon her fingertip, the poet inscribes something upon your palm.\nYou cannot read the symbols, but their warmth feels vivid and ardent — and yet not burning in the least.\nWhen you look up again, she is gone.",
          DialogueId = 6102112,
          GUID = "0F46A7C0",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "With the last of the ash upon her fingertip, the poet inscribes something upon your palm.\nYou cannot read the symbols, but their warmth feels vivid and ardent — and yet not burning in the least.\nWhen you look up again, she is gone."
        },
        [6102201] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"O fickle God of Fate... At times Thou grantest joy, at times castest down in woe..." 
"Yet still we cleave to reverence... For Thy thread of purest white shall, in the end, bind us to the bliss of the Heaven above Heavens..." 
The boy recites with solemn devotion, wholly unaware of your presence.]],
          DialogueId = 6102201,
          GUID = "0F46B65A",
          NextDialogue = 6102202,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room321_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"O fickle God of Fate... At times Thou grantest joy, at times castest down in woe..." 
"Yet still we cleave to reverence... For Thy thread of purest white shall, in the end, bind us to the bliss of the Heaven above Heavens..." 
The boy recites with solemn devotion, wholly unaware of your presence.]]
        },
        [6102202] = {
          ContentEN = "You draw nearer, stealing a glance at the book in his hands.\nJust as you remembered, the hymnal pages are defaced with writhing black script steeped in malice — as though straining to tear itself free of the page.",
          DialogueId = 6102202,
          GUID = "0F46B684",
          NextDialogue = 6102203,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You draw nearer, stealing a glance at the book in his hands.\nJust as you remembered, the hymnal pages are defaced with writhing black script steeped in malice — as though straining to tear itself free of the page."
        },
        [6102203] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Hello... are you here to read as well?" 
At last he notices you, lifting his head in quiet curiosity.]],
          DialogueId = 6102203,
          GUID = "0F46B6AE",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102204,
            [2] = 6102208
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room321_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Hello... are you here to read as well?" 
At last he notices you, lifting his head in quiet curiosity.]]
        },
        [6102204] = {
          ContentEN = "Stop him from reading.",
          DialogueId = 6102204,
          GUID = "0F46B6D8",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102205,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Stop him from reading."
        },
        [6102205] = {
          ContentEN = "You pull the book from his hands and snap it shut.",
          DialogueId = 6102205,
          GUID = "0F46B702",
          NextDialogue = 6102206,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You pull the book from his hands and snap it shut."
        },
        [6102206] = {
          ContentEN = "\"What are you—!?\" \nHe exclaims, worry creasing his brow. Then, staring at his empty hands, his voice drops to a murmur.\n\"Wait... I don't have to read anymore? I... I'm free?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102206,
          GUID = "0F46B72C",
          NextDialogue = 6102207,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room321_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"What are you—!?\" \nHe exclaims, worry creasing his brow. Then, staring at his empty hands, his voice drops to a murmur.\n\"Wait... I don't have to read anymore? I... I'm free?\""
        },
        [6102207] = {
          ContentEN = "You suppress the pain prickling at your fingertips, and offer a faint smile. Then, you hurl the book into the fire.\nThe flames roar skyward — black thistles rising with them, lashing upward like a storm.",
          DialogueId = 6102207,
          GUID = "0F46B756",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You suppress the pain prickling at your fingertips, and offer a faint smile. Then, you hurl the book into the fire.\nThe flames roar skyward — black thistles rising with them, lashing upward like a storm."
        },
        [6102208] = {
          ContentEN = "Remain silent.",
          DialogueId = 6102208,
          GUID = "0F46B780",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102209,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Remain silent."
        },
        [6102209] = {
          ContentEN = [[
You know, in your heart, that whatever you do now will not change what awaits him.
There is a greater task before you: to gather Glazeystal, and bring this long nightmare to an end.]],
          DialogueId = 6102209,
          GUID = "0F46B7AA",
          NextDialogue = 6102210,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
You know, in your heart, that whatever you do now will not change what awaits him.
There is a greater task before you: to gather Glazeystal, and bring this long nightmare to an end.]]
        },
        [6102210] = {
          ContentEN = [[
In the blink of an eye, black thistles surge forth, swallowing the boy whole. 
You let out a soft sigh... and press onward.]],
          DialogueId = 6102210,
          GUID = "0F46B7D4",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
In the blink of an eye, black thistles surge forth, swallowing the boy whole. 
You let out a soft sigh... and press onward.]]
        },
        [6102301] = {
          ContentEN = "\"My child... quick — look, there's a fire here.\" \nOn the far side of the flames, a lone woman lifts her head and smiles. The firelight reveals the gaunt contours of her face.\n\"So warm... Thank you, kind stranger.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102301,
          GUID = "0F46C6C2",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102302
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room322_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"My child... quick — look, there's a fire here.\" \nOn the far side of the flames, a lone woman lifts her head and smiles. The firelight reveals the gaunt contours of her face.\n\"So warm... Thank you, kind stranger.\""
        },
        [6102302] = {
          ContentEN = "Ask where her child is.",
          DialogueId = 6102302,
          GUID = "0F46C6EC",
          NextDialogue = 6102303,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Ask where her child is."
        },
        [6102303] = {
          ContentEN = "\"My child is right here — see?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102303,
          GUID = "0F46C716",
          NextDialogue = 6102304,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room322_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"My child is right here — see?\""
        },
        [6102304] = {
          ContentEN = "You follow her gaze to a moss-covered stone, about waist height.\nSet into a crevice near its crown, a glittering brooch gleams, ringed with delicate moss — like a heart entombed.\nShe tenderly strokes the stone's surface, heedless of the soil clinging to her fingers.",
          DialogueId = 6102304,
          GUID = "0F46C740",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102305,
            [2] = 6102308
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You follow her gaze to a moss-covered stone, about waist height.\nSet into a crevice near its crown, a glittering brooch gleams, ringed with delicate moss — like a heart entombed.\nShe tenderly strokes the stone's surface, heedless of the soil clinging to her fingers."
        },
        [6102305] = {
          ContentEN = "Tell her the truth.",
          DialogueId = 6102305,
          GUID = "0F46C76A",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102306,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Tell her the truth."
        },
        [6102306] = {
          ContentEN = "\"What nonsense are you spouting!?\" \nHer eyes flare with sudden fury. She throws herself before the stone, shielding it with her body as her voice shatters into a hysterical scream:\n\"This is my child — she's right here! No one will take her from me... never again!\"",
          DialogueId = 6102306,
          GUID = "0F46C794",
          NextDialogue = 6102307,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room322_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"What nonsense are you spouting!?\" \nHer eyes flare with sudden fury. She throws herself before the stone, shielding it with her body as her voice shatters into a hysterical scream:\n\"This is my child — she's right here! No one will take her from me... never again!\""
        },
        [6102307] = {
          ContentEN = "You fall silent. \nPerhaps it was folly to pierce this fragile dream — you knew from the start that it would change nothing.\nSo you rise and walk away, leaving the fire to warm the woman... and her \"child.\" But in the darkness beyond, an Abyssoid stirs — and strikes.",
          DialogueId = 6102307,
          GUID = "0F46C7BE",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You fall silent. \nPerhaps it was folly to pierce this fragile dream — you knew from the start that it would change nothing.\nSo you rise and walk away, leaving the fire to warm the woman... and her \"child.\" But in the darkness beyond, an Abyssoid stirs — and strikes."
        },
        [6102308] = {
          ContentEN = "Play along.",
          DialogueId = 6102308,
          GUID = "0F46C7E8",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102309,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Play along."
        },
        [6102309] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Thank you. She's always been shy around strangers — but I think she rather likes you.\"\nThe woman's voice is gentle. Her hands keep stroking the moss-grown stone with tender, absent rhythm.\n\"Are you alone on the road? That will not do — your family must be worried... Hurry home now.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102309,
          GUID = "0F46C812",
          NextDialogue = 6102310,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room322_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Thank you. She's always been shy around strangers — but I think she rather likes you.\"\nThe woman's voice is gentle. Her hands keep stroking the moss-grown stone with tender, absent rhythm.\n\"Are you alone on the road? That will not do — your family must be worried... Hurry home now.\""
        },
        [6102310] = {
          ContentEN = [[
You thank her politely and turn to leave.
Behind you, the woman and her "child" fade into the shadows beyond the firelight.]],
          DialogueId = 6102310,
          GUID = "0F46C83C",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
You thank her politely and turn to leave.
Behind you, the woman and her "child" fade into the shadows beyond the firelight.]]
        },
        [6102401] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Gone... They're gone..." 
The hollow-eyed girl lies prone upon the ground, her hands fumbling blindly, nails digging into the earth.]],
          DialogueId = 6102401,
          GUID = "0F46D72A",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102402
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room323_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Gone... They're gone..." 
The hollow-eyed girl lies prone upon the ground, her hands fumbling blindly, nails digging into the earth.]]
        },
        [6102402] = {
          ContentEN = "Ask what she is searching for.",
          DialogueId = 6102402,
          GUID = "0F46D754",
          NextDialogue = 6102403,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Ask what she is searching for."
        },
        [6102403] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"My stones... my stones... I swear they were right here..."
She whispers, her gaze locked in despair upon the campfire at your feet.
"My flame... it's fading... What am I to do... what am I to do..."]],
          DialogueId = 6102403,
          GUID = "0F46D77E",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102404,
            [2] = 6102408
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room323_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"My stones... my stones... I swear they were right here..."
She whispers, her gaze locked in despair upon the campfire at your feet.
"My flame... it's fading... What am I to do... what am I to do..."]]
        },
        [6102404] = {
          ContentEN = "Help her.",
          DialogueId = 6102404,
          GUID = "0F46D7A8",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102405,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Help her."
        },
        [6102405] = {
          ContentEN = "You try to recall the stones she cherished. Though their origin eludes you, you sense that fire magic could shape something akin to them.\nUsing the campfire as a focus, you gather your power, channelling it through its heat...\nIn an instant, golden fragments fall like meteors from above — ringing softly as they strike the earth, each note bright as a bell.",
          DialogueId = 6102405,
          GUID = "0F46D7D2",
          NextDialogue = 6102406,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You try to recall the stones she cherished. Though their origin eludes you, you sense that fire magic could shape something akin to them.\nUsing the campfire as a focus, you gather your power, channelling it through its heat...\nIn an instant, golden fragments fall like meteors from above — ringing softly as they strike the earth, each note bright as a bell."
        },
        [6102406] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Ah...! My stones — these are my stones! Thank you, messenger of the gods!\"\nShe scoops them up one by one, cradling them in the fold of her skirt like treasures beyond price.",
          DialogueId = 6102406,
          GUID = "0F46D7FC",
          NextDialogue = 6102407,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room323_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Ah...! My stones — these are my stones! Thank you, messenger of the gods!\"\nShe scoops them up one by one, cradling them in the fold of her skirt like treasures beyond price."
        },
        [6102407] = {
          ContentEN = "They match the crystals you once glimpsed in her arms. You cannot help but wonder: were they always there — fragments left behind in some forgotten journey of your own?\nEither way, the girl has reclaimed her \"certainty\"... And you, too, must walk on.",
          DialogueId = 6102407,
          GUID = "0F46D826",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "They match the crystals you once glimpsed in her arms. You cannot help but wonder: were they always there — fragments left behind in some forgotten journey of your own?\nEither way, the girl has reclaimed her \"certainty\"... And you, too, must walk on."
        },
        [6102408] = {
          ContentEN = "Tell her that life doesn't always go the way we hope.",
          DialogueId = 6102408,
          GUID = "0F46D850",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102409,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Tell her that life doesn't always go the way we hope."
        },
        [6102409] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"I know... I know."
"That's why I've given up... I no longer read the books, nor ponder the origin of magic, nor ask what lies within that tower..." 
"All I want now is a scrap of firelight.. Is even that too much to ask?"]],
          DialogueId = 6102409,
          GUID = "0F46D87A",
          NextDialogue = 6102410,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room323_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"I know... I know."
"That's why I've given up... I no longer read the books, nor ponder the origin of magic, nor ask what lies within that tower..." 
"All I want now is a scrap of firelight.. Is even that too much to ask?"]]
        },
        [6102410] = {
          ContentEN = [[
You are left speechless. 
Suddenly, the girl rises to her feet. Before you can react, she steps resolutely into the fire.
Her form melts slowly into the blaze, until not a trace remains.
You turn away... and press on.]],
          DialogueId = 6102410,
          GUID = "0F46D8A4",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
You are left speechless. 
Suddenly, the girl rises to her feet. Before you can react, she steps resolutely into the fire.
Her form melts slowly into the blaze, until not a trace remains.
You turn away... and press on.]]
        },
        [6102501] = {
          ContentEN = "The campfire burns quietly. This time, no Phantasms stir within its glow. \nAs you turn to leave, something catches your eye —\nScattered across the soil at your feet, tiny golden stones gleam like stars fallen from the heavens.",
          DialogueId = 6102501,
          GUID = "0F46E792",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102502,
            [2] = 6102506
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The campfire burns quietly. This time, no Phantasms stir within its glow. \nAs you turn to leave, something catches your eye —\nScattered across the soil at your feet, tiny golden stones gleam like stars fallen from the heavens."
        },
        [6102502] = {
          ContentEN = "Pick up the stones and cast them into the fire.",
          DialogueId = 6102502,
          GUID = "0F46E7BC",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102503,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Pick up the stones and cast them into the fire."
        },
        [6102503] = {
          ContentEN = "The flames leap higher — then stretch unnaturally to either side.\nYou step back, wary. Suddenly, a figure takes shape within the blaze... And you see that the light streaming outward is not flame at all, but strands of a girl's hair.",
          DialogueId = 6102503,
          GUID = "0F46E7E6",
          NextDialogue = 6102504,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The flames leap higher — then stretch unnaturally to either side.\nYou step back, wary. Suddenly, a figure takes shape within the blaze... And you see that the light streaming outward is not flame at all, but strands of a girl's hair."
        },
        [6102504] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Hello! You found my stones, didn't you?\"\nThe girl leaps from the fire, tossing her head as golden pebbles tumble from her hair with a bright, crackling chime.\n\"Now I need never search again — see? So long as I step into the fire, I can make the stones myself!\"",
          DialogueId = 6102504,
          GUID = "0F46E810",
          NextDialogue = 6102505,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room324_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Hello! You found my stones, didn't you?\"\nThe girl leaps from the fire, tossing her head as golden pebbles tumble from her hair with a bright, crackling chime.\n\"Now I need never search again — see? So long as I step into the fire, I can make the stones myself!\""
        },
        [6102505] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Forgive me, I've no time for chitchat — I'm still far from collecting all one hundred and forty-six.\"\n\"But I found something that may aid you. Please, take it — and may your journey be swift and safe!\"\nShe presses something into your hand, then vanishes once more into the flames.",
          DialogueId = 6102505,
          GUID = "0F46E83A",
          NextDialogue = 6102510,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room324_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Forgive me, I've no time for chitchat — I'm still far from collecting all one hundred and forty-six.\"\n\"But I found something that may aid you. Please, take it — and may your journey be swift and safe!\"\nShe presses something into your hand, then vanishes once more into the flames."
        },
        [6102506] = {
          ContentEN = "Observe quietly.",
          DialogueId = 6102506,
          GUID = "0F46E864",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102507,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Observe quietly."
        },
        [6102507] = {
          ContentEN = "The fire burns on, steady and soft. For a moment, you fancy you hear a voice within the flames.",
          DialogueId = 6102507,
          GUID = "0F46E88E",
          NextDialogue = 6102508,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The fire burns on, steady and soft. For a moment, you fancy you hear a voice within the flames."
        },
        [6102508] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Yes... yes. I'll keep it in mind.\"\nThe girl's gentle, contented voice drifts from the fire.\n\"Questions must know their limits. Flame is the gift of the gods, not merely matter reacting to heat. Just like these stones — treasures bestowed upon me, that I might sleep in peace...\"",
          DialogueId = 6102508,
          GUID = "0F46E8B8",
          NextDialogue = 6102509,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room324_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Yes... yes. I'll keep it in mind.\"\nThe girl's gentle, contented voice drifts from the fire.\n\"Questions must know their limits. Flame is the gift of the gods, not merely matter reacting to heat. Just like these stones — treasures bestowed upon me, that I might sleep in peace...\""
        },
        [6102509] = {
          ContentEN = "You turn away in silence. A stone rolls to the path before you. You step forward — and inadvertently crush it beneath your boot.\nThe treasure of the gods... so fragile, after all.",
          DialogueId = 6102509,
          GUID = "0F46E8E2",
          NextDialogue = 6102510,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You turn away in silence. A stone rolls to the path before you. You step forward — and inadvertently crush it beneath your boot.\nThe treasure of the gods... so fragile, after all."
        },
        [6102510] = {
          ContentEN = "And you wonder — was that flame a \"certainty\" that granted her peace... or a \"shackle\" that bound her still? \nPerhaps the two were never different at all.",
          DialogueId = 6102510,
          GUID = "0F46E90C",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "And you wonder — was that flame a \"certainty\" that granted her peace... or a \"shackle\" that bound her still? \nPerhaps the two were never different at all."
        },
        [6102601] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Forgive me... it's all my fault... I'm too stupid to remember the hymns... Too lazy to sit through the sermons..."
"O divine ones, please forgive me..."]],
          DialogueId = 6102601,
          GUID = "0F46F7FA",
          NextDialogue = 6102602,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room325_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Forgive me... it's all my fault... I'm too stupid to remember the hymns... Too lazy to sit through the sermons..."
"O divine ones, please forgive me..."]]
        },
        [6102602] = {
          ContentEN = "The girl murmurs her confession as though no one's watching — or perhaps, she no longer sees anyone at all.\nShe looks worse than last time; even her eyes have lost their light.",
          DialogueId = 6102602,
          GUID = "0F46F824",
          NextDialogue = 6102603,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The girl murmurs her confession as though no one's watching — or perhaps, she no longer sees anyone at all.\nShe looks worse than last time; even her eyes have lost their light."
        },
        [6102603] = {
          ContentEN = "\"You are... the traveller... Has it been so long already?\" \nAt last, she notices you — turning her head with weary slowness. \n\"Traveller... tell me... why is it that though I pray day and night, the gods never answer?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102603,
          GUID = "0F46F84E",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102604,
            [2] = 6102608
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room325_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"You are... the traveller... Has it been so long already?\" \nAt last, she notices you — turning her head with weary slowness. \n\"Traveller... tell me... why is it that though I pray day and night, the gods never answer?\""
        },
        [6102604] = {
          ContentEN = "Encourage her to continue her prayers.",
          DialogueId = 6102604,
          GUID = "0F46F878",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102605,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Encourage her to continue her prayers."
        },
        [6102605] = {
          ContentEN = "It was not yet time to change her fate. So you let the lie endure — for even falsehood may serve as a form of hope.\nYou tell her that if she continues to pray, then salvation will come one day.\nAnd it is not wholly untrue. You believe the Abyss may yet be overcome. It's just that her prayers do not matter. The truth lies not in ritual — but in the Lantern you bear.",
          DialogueId = 6102605,
          GUID = "0F46F8A2",
          NextDialogue = 6102606,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "It was not yet time to change her fate. So you let the lie endure — for even falsehood may serve as a form of hope.\nYou tell her that if she continues to pray, then salvation will come one day.\nAnd it is not wholly untrue. You believe the Abyss may yet be overcome. It's just that her prayers do not matter. The truth lies not in ritual — but in the Lantern you bear."
        },
        [6102606] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"I see... I believe you." 
She clasps her hands and resumes her prayers, her voice steadier than before.]],
          DialogueId = 6102606,
          GUID = "0F46F8CC",
          NextDialogue = 6102607,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room325_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"I see... I believe you." 
She clasps her hands and resumes her prayers, her voice steadier than before.]]
        },
        [6102607] = {
          ContentEN = "With a quiet sigh, you tighten your grip on the Lantern — and press onward.",
          DialogueId = 6102607,
          GUID = "0F46F8F6",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "With a quiet sigh, you tighten your grip on the Lantern — and press onward."
        },
        [6102608] = {
          ContentEN = "Tell her the gods will not answer.",
          DialogueId = 6102608,
          GUID = "0F46F920",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102609,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Tell her the gods will not answer."
        },
        [6102609] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"The gods... will never answer me?" 
"Is it because my sins are too deep... that I am no longer worthy of salvation?" 
She looks at you in despair, tears slipping down cheeks already pocked with sores.]],
          DialogueId = 6102609,
          GUID = "0F46F94A",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102610
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room325_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"The gods... will never answer me?" 
"Is it because my sins are too deep... that I am no longer worthy of salvation?" 
She looks at you in despair, tears slipping down cheeks already pocked with sores.]]
        },
        [6102610] = {
          ContentEN = "\"It is because you never bore any sin.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102610,
          GUID = "0F46F974",
          NextDialogue = 6102611,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "\"It is because you never bore any sin.\""
        },
        [6102611] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Huh...?" 
The girl freezes, her eyes wide with confusion.]],
          DialogueId = 6102611,
          GUID = "0F46F99E",
          NextDialogue = 6102612,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room325_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Huh...?" 
The girl freezes, her eyes wide with confusion.]]
        },
        [6102612] = {
          ContentEN = "You give her a steady smile and make her a promise: that you will find a way to end her suffering.\nShe stares at you, half comprehending... and gives a faint nod. Then you notice — her wounds have ceased to bleed.\nWith a final wave, you tighten your grip on the Lantern, and press onward.",
          DialogueId = 6102612,
          GUID = "0F46F9C8",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You give her a steady smile and make her a promise: that you will find a way to end her suffering.\nShe stares at you, half comprehending... and gives a faint nod. Then you notice — her wounds have ceased to bleed.\nWith a final wave, you tighten your grip on the Lantern, and press onward."
        },
        [6102701] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Fusa, Goddess of the Full Moon—\"\n\"Mistress of radiant paths, Weaver of destiny's threads...\"\n\"By the dome and the moonlight as witness, we lift our hymn of devotion unto You...\"",
          DialogueId = 6102701,
          GUID = "0F470862",
          NextDialogue = 6102702,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room326_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Fusa, Goddess of the Full Moon—\"\n\"Mistress of radiant paths, Weaver of destiny's threads...\"\n\"By the dome and the moonlight as witness, we lift our hymn of devotion unto You...\""
        },
        [6102702] = {
          ContentEN = "Figures rise within the fire, their voices joined in solemn prayer.",
          DialogueId = 6102702,
          GUID = "0F47088C",
          NextDialogue = 6102703,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Figures rise within the fire, their voices joined in solemn prayer."
        },
        [6102703] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Who are you? A traveller astray?\" \nOne worshipper turns towards you, smiling gently as she reaches out her hand. \n\"Come — join us in prayer to the Goddess of the Full Moon. Surely She will bless the path before you.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102703,
          GUID = "0F4708B6",
          NextDialogue = 6102704,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room326_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Who are you? A traveller astray?\" \nOne worshipper turns towards you, smiling gently as she reaches out her hand. \n\"Come — join us in prayer to the Goddess of the Full Moon. Surely She will bless the path before you.\""
        },
        [6102704] = {
          ContentEN = "They raise their hymn to <H>Fusa</>, Goddess of Fate — <H>ninth among the Great Nine</>.\nShe who reigns over the full moon, and draws down its silvery light to weave the threads of fate.",
          DialogueId = 6102704,
          GUID = "0F4708E0",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102705,
            [2] = 6102709
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "They raise their hymn to Fusa, Goddess of Fate — ninth among the Great Nine.\nShe who reigns over the full moon, and draws down its silvery light to weave the threads of fate."
        },
        [6102705] = {
          ContentEN = "Join their prayer.",
          DialogueId = 6102705,
          GUID = "0F47090A",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102706,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Join their prayer."
        },
        [6102706] = {
          ContentEN = "This was the kind of gathering you once despised as a child — hollow praises, memorised and soon forgotten. Yet now, a faint nostalgia stirs within you.\nYou bow your head and join them in prayer.",
          DialogueId = 6102706,
          GUID = "0F470934",
          NextDialogue = 6102707,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "This was the kind of gathering you once despised as a child — hollow praises, memorised and soon forgotten. Yet now, a faint nostalgia stirs within you.\nYou bow your head and join them in prayer."
        },
        [6102707] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Fusa, Goddess of the Full Moon, ever constant across the heavens, amidst fate's turning."
"To You we give honour. Bless Your faithful..."
"And grant us flawless fortune and joy."]],
          DialogueId = 6102707,
          GUID = "0F47095E",
          NextDialogue = 6102708,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          SpeakNpcId = 910004,
          Subtitle = [[
"Fusa, Goddess of the Full Moon, ever constant across the heavens, amidst fate's turning."
"To You we give honour. Bless Your faithful..."
"And grant us flawless fortune and joy."]]
        },
        [6102708] = {
          ContentEN = [[
Eyes closed, you echo the devotion of the faithful.
And when you open them again, the figures are gone.]],
          DialogueId = 6102708,
          GUID = "0F470988",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
Eyes closed, you echo the devotion of the faithful.
And when you open them again, the figures are gone.]]
        },
        [6102709] = {
          ContentEN = "Refuse to join their prayer.",
          DialogueId = 6102709,
          GUID = "0F4709B2",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102710,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Refuse to join their prayer."
        },
        [6102710] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Refuse? You—why!?\" \nThe worshipper's voice sharpens with disbelief.\n\"Heretic! Are you of the Noclunism? A follower of Nepha!?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102710,
          GUID = "0F4709DC",
          NextDialogue = 6102711,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room326_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Refuse? You—why!?\" \nThe worshipper's voice sharpens with disbelief.\n\"Heretic! Are you of the Noclunism? A follower of Nepha!?\""
        },
        [6102711] = {
          ContentEN = "At that forbidden name, all eyes turn. Their faces twist — the warmth gone, replaced by grotesque hatred.\nYou sigh. There's no avoiding it now — you'll have to break free from their encircling ranks.",
          DialogueId = 6102711,
          GUID = "0F470A06",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "At that forbidden name, all eyes turn. Their faces twist — the warmth gone, replaced by grotesque hatred.\nYou sigh. There's no avoiding it now — you'll have to break free from their encircling ranks."
        },
        [6102801] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Shears of fate's thread, Mistress of eternal stillness..."
"By the Abyss and the long night as witness, hear my humble prayer..."]],
          DialogueId = 6102801,
          GUID = "0F4718CA",
          NextDialogue = 6102802,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room327_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Shears of fate's thread, Mistress of eternal stillness..."
"By the Abyss and the long night as witness, hear my humble prayer..."]]
        },
        [6102802] = {
          ContentEN = [[
Figures rise once more within the fire, their voices joined in solemn chant.
You listen in silence. The words are unfamiliar to you.]],
          DialogueId = 6102802,
          GUID = "0F4718F4",
          NextDialogue = 6102803,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
Figures rise once more within the fire, their voices joined in solemn chant.
You listen in silence. The words are unfamiliar to you.]]
        },
        [6102803] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Who are you? A traveller astray?\" \nOne worshipper turns towards you, smiling gently as she reaches out her hand. \n\"Or have you too glimpsed the hidden truth — and come seeking the embrace of the true saviour, Nepha?\"",
          DialogueId = 6102803,
          GUID = "0F47191E",
          NextDialogue = 6102804,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room327_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Who are you? A traveller astray?\" \nOne worshipper turns towards you, smiling gently as she reaches out her hand. \n\"Or have you too glimpsed the hidden truth — and come seeking the embrace of the true saviour, Nepha?\""
        },
        [6102804] = {
          ContentEN = "<H>Nepha</>... you remember the name. \nRarely mentioned in the Orthodox texts of Elysium... you have seen it only in dust-laden scrolls, half-effaced by time. A forbidden name — the long forgotten <H>tenth deity</>.",
          DialogueId = 6102804,
          GUID = "0F471948",
          NextDialogue = 6102805,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Nepha... you remember the name. \nRarely mentioned in the Orthodox texts of Elysium... you have seen it only in dust-laden scrolls, half-effaced by time. A forbidden name — the long forgotten tenth deity."
        },
        [6102805] = {
          ContentEN = "She was the Goddess of the Dark Moon and of Death. Sister to Fusa.\nWhile her elder sister weaves the threads of fate, Nepha severs them.\nTheir endless struggle gave rise to the waxing and waning of the moon, and stirred the tides.\nIf these people are Her followers, then they must be—",
          DialogueId = 6102805,
          GUID = "0F471972",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102806
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "She was the Goddess of the Dark Moon and of Death. Sister to Fusa.\nWhile her elder sister weaves the threads of fate, Nepha severs them.\nTheir endless struggle gave rise to the waxing and waning of the moon, and stirred the tides.\nIf these people are Her followers, then they must be—"
        },
        [6102806] = {
          ContentEN = "Ask about their faith.",
          DialogueId = 6102806,
          GUID = "0F47199C",
          NextDialogue = 6102807,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Ask about their faith."
        },
        [6102807] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Since you stand here, you must already know — the Abyss is not a lifeless pit. It is alive. Ever growing. Ever spreading.\"\n\"The golden holy sword of the knights cannot hold back its dark tide. The light of the Full Moon cannot pierce the abysmal quiet.\"\n\"As every light races towards its extinguishing, so too must all living things meet their end. The only certainty... is perishing. The Abyss is the world's true form.\"\n\"Welcome, dear traveller — to the <H>Noclunism</>.\"",
          DialogueId = 6102807,
          GUID = "0F4719C6",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102808,
            [2] = 6102811
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room327_Char02",
          Subtitle = "\"Since you stand here, you must already know — the Abyss is not a lifeless pit. It is alive. Ever growing. Ever spreading.\"\n\"The golden holy sword of the knights cannot hold back its dark tide. The light of the Full Moon cannot pierce the abysmal quiet.\"\n\"As every light races towards its extinguishing, so too must all living things meet their end. The only certainty... is perishing. The Abyss is the world's true form.\"\n\"Welcome, dear traveller — to the Noclunism.\""
        },
        [6102808] = {
          ContentEN = "Accept their invitation.",
          DialogueId = 6102808,
          GUID = "0F4719F0",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102809,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Accept their invitation."
        },
        [6102809] = {
          ContentEN = "Even if they were only phantoms, you wish not to provoke them needlessly.\nSo, with a solemn expression and well-practised tone, you begin to recite the tenets of the Noclunism — fragments once heard and half-remembered: \"The deathward instinct\"... \"Nepha's salvation\"... \"The Abyss is eternity itself\"... \nTheir faces soften. They nod again and again, pleased by your borrowed eloquence.",
          DialogueId = 6102809,
          GUID = "0F471A1A",
          NextDialogue = 6102810,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Even if they were only phantoms, you wish not to provoke them needlessly.\nSo, with a solemn expression and well-practised tone, you begin to recite the tenets of the Noclunism — fragments once heard and half-remembered: \"The deathward instinct\"... \"Nepha's salvation\"... \"The Abyss is eternity itself\"... \nTheir faces soften. They nod again and again, pleased by your borrowed eloquence."
        },
        [6102810] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Your great learning humbles us, your wisdom humbles us. Please — accept these gifts, friend!\" \nYou bluff your way through. Perhaps... not every sermon of your youth is wasted on wandering thoughts.",
          DialogueId = 6102810,
          GUID = "0F471A44",
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room327_Char02",
          Subtitle = "\"Your great learning humbles us, your wisdom humbles us. Please — accept these gifts, friend!\" \nYou bluff your way through. Perhaps... not every sermon of your youth is wasted on wandering thoughts."
        },
        [6102811] = {
          ContentEN = "Refuse their invitation.",
          DialogueId = 6102811,
          GUID = "0F471A6E",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6102812,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Refuse their invitation."
        },
        [6102812] = {
          ContentEN = "Along this weary road, you too have pondered often —\nthe meaning of life, the meaning of death. At times, you've believed that death might be the only release.\nBut <H>those few chance encounters</>... They've rekindled your reason to keep walking — through the dark, and through the doubt. Now, your resolve burns like a flame:\nYou will drive back the dark, even if it means burning your own body as kindling. Even if your light endures for only a moment — you will blaze against this stagnant eternity.",
          DialogueId = 6102812,
          GUID = "0F471A98",
          NextDialogue = 6102813,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Along this weary road, you too have pondered often —\nthe meaning of life, the meaning of death. At times, you've believed that death might be the only release.\nBut those few chance encounters... They've rekindled your reason to keep walking — through the dark, and through the doubt. Now, your resolve burns like a flame:\nYou will drive back the dark, even if it means burning your own body as kindling. Even if your light endures for only a moment — you will blaze against this stagnant eternity."
        },
        [6102813] = {
          ContentEN = "\"The Abyss is not Eternity. You are but echoes — phantoms of lives once lived.\"\nYou raise your weapon. \n\"Back to where you belong, souls of the departed—\"",
          DialogueId = 6102813,
          GUID = "0F471AC2",
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          SpeakNpcId = 910004,
          Subtitle = "\"The Abyss is not Eternity. You are but echoes — phantoms of lives once lived.\"\nYou raise your weapon. \n\"Back to where you belong, souls of the departed—\""
        },
        [6102901] = {
          ContentEN = "You settle beside the campfire for a rest.\nSuddenly, a faint sound tickles your ear... then rises, drifting somewhere above.\nIt swells — a soft, feathery rustle, like velvet wings brushing together.",
          DialogueId = 6102901,
          GUID = "0F472932",
          NextDialogue = 6102902,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You settle beside the campfire for a rest.\nSuddenly, a faint sound tickles your ear... then rises, drifting somewhere above.\nIt swells — a soft, feathery rustle, like velvet wings brushing together."
        },
        [6102902] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Hey there! Lucky traveller!\"",
          DialogueId = 6102902,
          GUID = "0F47295C",
          NextDialogue = 6102903,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room381_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Hey there! Lucky traveller!\""
        },
        [6102903] = {
          ContentEN = "A flurry of vibrant feathers rains down from above — more colours than you've ever seen in the Abyssum.\nYou find yourself knee-deep in absurd fluff, like the butt of a street prank caught between comedy and pity.",
          DialogueId = 6102903,
          GUID = "0F472986",
          NextDialogue = 6102904,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "A flurry of vibrant feathers rains down from above — more colours than you've ever seen in the Abyssum.\nYou find yourself knee-deep in absurd fluff, like the butt of a street prank caught between comedy and pity."
        },
        [6102904] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Hello? Aren't you going to react? How long have you been down here? Isn't it dull yet?"
A figure descends upside-down, eyes level with yours. He wears a comical bird mask, the beak swaying dangerously close to your nose.
How he's holding that pose, you can't begin to guess.]],
          DialogueId = 6102904,
          GUID = "0F4729B0",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102905
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room381_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Hello? Aren't you going to react? How long have you been down here? Isn't it dull yet?"
A figure descends upside-down, eyes level with yours. He wears a comical bird mask, the beak swaying dangerously close to your nose.
How he's holding that pose, you can't begin to guess.]]
        },
        [6102905] = {
          ContentEN = "I don't have time for this.",
          DialogueId = 6102905,
          GUID = "0F4729DA",
          NextDialogue = 6102906,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "I don't have time for this."
        },
        [6102906] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Aw, don't be so frosty. Didn't those Elysian fogeys ever tell you? A good deed a day keeps bad luck away!"
"Come on, <H>play a little game</> with me. Win, and I'll give you a prize. Lose? No punishment. Nothing's at stake here. What do you say?"]],
          DialogueId = 6102906,
          GUID = "0F472A04",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6102907
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room381_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Aw, don't be so frosty. Didn't those Elysian fogeys ever tell you? A good deed a day keeps bad luck away!"
"Come on, play a little game with me. Win, and I'll give you a prize. Lose? No punishment. Nothing's at stake here. What do you say?"]]
        },
        [6102907] = {
          ContentEN = "Alright then.",
          DialogueId = 6102907,
          GUID = "0F472A2E",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Alright then."
        },
        [6103001] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"O let us raise a hymn to <H>Shaliel</>!" 
"He, the hallowed Saint of Elysium..."
"Who hearkened to Fusa's revelation, and taught mankind mercy, forgiveness, and love."
"Upon the crimson soil of Elysium, peace once more put forth its tender shoots."]],
          DialogueId = 6103001,
          GUID = "0F47399A",
          NextDialogue = 6103002,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room328_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"O let us raise a hymn to Shaliel!" 
"He, the hallowed Saint of Elysium..."
"Who hearkened to Fusa's revelation, and taught mankind mercy, forgiveness, and love."
"Upon the crimson soil of Elysium, peace once more put forth its tender shoots."]]
        },
        [6103002] = {
          ContentEN = "An old man stands near the broken wall, garbed in a bard's robe. One hand brushes its weathered surface as he sings.\nThough fractured, the wall is well preserved. And in the Lantern's faint glow, a mural emerges — a towering image of the very <H>Shaliel</> the bard exalts.\nShaliel — saint of two millennia past, one of the first <H>Seven Virtues</>: Temperance.\nThe bard sings on, unaware of your presence.",
          DialogueId = 6103002,
          GUID = "0F4739C4",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6103003
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "An old man stands near the broken wall, garbed in a bard's robe. One hand brushes its weathered surface as he sings.\nThough fractured, the wall is well preserved. And in the Lantern's faint glow, a mural emerges — a towering image of the very Shaliel the bard exalts.\nShaliel — saint of two millennia past, one of the first Seven Virtues: Temperance.\nThe bard sings on, unaware of your presence."
        },
        [6103003] = {
          ContentEN = "Keep listening.",
          DialogueId = 6103003,
          GUID = "0F4739EE",
          NextDialogue = 6103004,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Keep listening."
        },
        [6103004] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Yet the Saint's heart was ever troubled:\"\n\"by Fusa's promise to mankind — the Heaven above Heavens.\"\n\"At last, after seventy-seven days of stillness beside the azure lake,\"\n\"beneath the full moon, he beheld the truth... and in its waters, he touched Eternity.\"",
          DialogueId = 6103004,
          GUID = "0F473A18",
          NextDialogue = 6103005,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room328_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Yet the Saint's heart was ever troubled:\"\n\"by Fusa's promise to mankind — the Heaven above Heavens.\"\n\"At last, after seventy-seven days of stillness beside the azure lake,\"\n\"beneath the full moon, he beheld the truth... and in its waters, he touched Eternity.\""
        },
        [6103005] = {
          ContentEN = "You understand the song.\nAt the lake's edge, Shaliel received revelation from Fusa — Goddess of Fate. His soul departed then for the Heaven above Heavens, attaining what the faithful called Eternity. Thus was he the first of the Chosen.\nAnd in the years that followed, others too bore the divine brands. One by one, they crossed the holy lake, and reached the promised land.\nSuch were the early tales of the Elysian Church. You remember them well.",
          DialogueId = 6103005,
          GUID = "0F473A42",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6103006
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You understand the song.\nAt the lake's edge, Shaliel received revelation from Fusa — Goddess of Fate. His soul departed then for the Heaven above Heavens, attaining what the faithful called Eternity. Thus was he the first of the Chosen.\nAnd in the years that followed, others too bore the divine brands. One by one, they crossed the holy lake, and reached the promised land.\nSuch were the early tales of the Elysian Church. You remember them well."
        },
        [6103006] = {
          ContentEN = "Keep listening.",
          DialogueId = 6103006,
          GUID = "0F473A6C",
          NextDialogue = 6103007,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Keep listening."
        },
        [6103007] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Yet two thousand years hence, when I gaze from the hills upon the holy lake...\"\n\"Why is there naught but a black whirlpool?\"\n\"O Shaliel, our Saint of Wisdom...\"\n\"Tell me — where lies the paradise the Goddess once promised?\"",
          DialogueId = 6103007,
          GUID = "0F473A96",
          NextDialogue = 6103008,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room328_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Yet two thousand years hence, when I gaze from the hills upon the holy lake...\"\n\"Why is there naught but a black whirlpool?\"\n\"O Shaliel, our Saint of Wisdom...\"\n\"Tell me — where lies the paradise the Goddess once promised?\""
        },
        [6103008] = {
          ContentEN = "The bard sings, and tears fall. The theme of his song has shifted from distant glory to the vile gloom before your eyes.\nNo one knows exactly when it began. But one night, without warning, the Sacred Lake — purest and holiest to the Elysian faithful for two thousand years — was devoured by the Abyss.\nAnd just as the apostates once said a thousand years ago: \"The Great Nine are dead!\" \nWill you keep listening?",
          DialogueId = 6103008,
          GUID = "0F473AC0",
          NextOptions = {
            [1] = 6103009,
            [2] = 6103013
          },
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The bard sings, and tears fall. The theme of his song has shifted from distant glory to the vile gloom before your eyes.\nNo one knows exactly when it began. But one night, without warning, the Sacred Lake — purest and holiest to the Elysian faithful for two thousand years — was devoured by the Abyss.\nAnd just as the apostates once said a thousand years ago: \"The Great Nine are dead!\" \nWill you keep listening?"
        },
        [6103009] = {
          ContentEN = "Keep listening.",
          DialogueId = 6103009,
          GUID = "0F473AEA",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6103010,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Keep listening."
        },
        [6103010] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Why does the foul Abyss give no word?\"\n\"The silver gleam of the full moon falls upon me — yet the Goddess does not answer.\"\n\"O Shaliel, is it true, as the followers of the Noclunism whisper:\"\n\"You never reached the Heaven above Heavens — but turned your back upon the moon... and became a devil?\"",
          DialogueId = 6103010,
          GUID = "0F473B14",
          NextDialogue = 6103011,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcId = 910005,
          SpeakNpcName = "RougeLike_Room328_Char01",
          Subtitle = "\"Why does the foul Abyss give no word?\"\n\"The silver gleam of the full moon falls upon me — yet the Goddess does not answer.\"\n\"O Shaliel, is it true, as the followers of the Noclunism whisper:\"\n\"You never reached the Heaven above Heavens — but turned your back upon the moon... and became a devil?\""
        },
        [6103011] = {
          ContentEN = "\"Hold on — what are you saying?\" \nThe bard's words strike you unawares. It is the heretics' most dangerous rumour — that the lake was never sacred, that Shaliel, first among the Chosen, was not saved... but sacrificed.\nYou remember now — <H>someone</> once whispered this to you.",
          DialogueId = 6103011,
          GUID = "0F473B3E",
          NextDialogue = 6103012,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          SpeakNpcId = 910004,
          Subtitle = "\"Hold on — what are you saying?\" \nThe bard's words strike you unawares. It is the heretics' most dangerous rumour — that the lake was never sacred, that Shaliel, first among the Chosen, was not saved... but sacrificed.\nYou remember now — someone once whispered this to you."
        },
        [6103012] = {
          ContentEN = [[
But the bard only strums his lyre, his voice fading into yet another verse. As if you were never there at all.
His voice recedes, until even his figure is gone.]],
          DialogueId = 6103012,
          GUID = "0F473B68",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
But the bard only strums his lyre, his voice fading into yet another verse. As if you were never there at all.
His voice recedes, until even his figure is gone.]]
        },
        [6103013] = {
          ContentEN = "Leave this place.",
          DialogueId = 6103013,
          GUID = "0F473B92",
          IsKeyOption = true,
          NextDialogue = 6103014,
          RougeTalkActorType = 2,
          Subtitle = "Leave this place."
        },
        [6103014] = {
          ContentEN = [[
You call out a few times, hoping to draw the bard's attention. You wish to speak with him. But he sings on, lost in his ancient hymn.
No words of worth will come from him now. At last, you turn away.]],
          DialogueId = 6103014,
          GUID = "0F473BBC",
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = [[
You call out a few times, hoping to draw the bard's attention. You wish to speak with him. But he sings on, lost in his ancient hymn.
No words of worth will come from him now. At last, you turn away.]]
        },
        [6200101] = {
          ContentEN = "Youthful chatter carries through the gloom — a sound you haven't heard in the abyss for ages. Vibrant. Alive. Untainted by the creeping darkness.\nYou know with absolute certainty these aren't souls or illusions, but living, breathing humans. The tone of their conversation suggests they've only just arrived.",
          DialogueId = 6200101,
          GUID = "0F857412",
          NextDialogue = 6200102,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "Youthful chatter carries through the gloom — a sound you haven't heard in the abyss for ages. Vibrant. Alive. Untainted by the creeping darkness.\nYou know with absolute certainty these aren't souls or illusions, but living, breathing humans. The tone of their conversation suggests they've only just arrived."
        },
        [6200102] = {
          ContentEN = "You can't resist following the sound. You push forward as the mist begins to part — revealing four young Knights standing before you.\nTheir attire and gear vary, yet each bears the fleur-de-lis emblem of Elysium.",
          DialogueId = 6200102,
          GUID = "0F85743C",
          NextDialogue = 6200103,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You can't resist following the sound. You push forward as the mist begins to part — revealing four young Knights standing before you.\nTheir attire and gear vary, yet each bears the fleur-de-lis emblem of Elysium."
        },
        [6200103] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Are you sure this is the right way, Captain?"
The blonde Knight bounds up the ancient staircase and leaps back down in one fluid motion.
"It's just another pile of rubble."]],
          DialogueId = 6200103,
          GUID = "0F857466",
          NextDialogue = 6200104,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcName = "StoryEvent11_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"Are you sure this is the right way, Captain?"
The blonde Knight bounds up the ancient staircase and leaps back down in one fluid motion.
"It's just another pile of rubble."]]
        },
        [6200104] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"At least I know we haven't been here before."
The young captain strides past her with measured steps.
"Navigating the Sacred Lake is impossible. We'll just have to take it step by step."]],
          DialogueId = 6200104,
          GUID = "0F857490",
          NextDialogue = 6200105,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcName = "StoryEvent11_Char02",
          Subtitle = [[
"At least I know we haven't been here before."
The young captain strides past her with measured steps.
"Navigating the Sacred Lake is impossible. We'll just have to take it step by step."]]
        },
        [6200105] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"And, don't you ever get tired bouncing around like that, Cathy?"
The young captain sighs as he watches his hyperactive teammate.
"Save your energy. This place is dangerous. Let's not take unnecessary risks."]],
          DialogueId = 6200105,
          GUID = "0F8574BA",
          NextDialogue = 6200106,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcName = "StoryEvent11_Char02",
          Subtitle = [[
"And, don't you ever get tired bouncing around like that, Cathy?"
The young captain sighs as he watches his hyperactive teammate.
"Save your energy. This place is dangerous. Let's not take unnecessary risks."]]
        },
        [6200106] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"I have lots of energy to spare! You're the one who's lugging around that massive sword and shield."
With a flick of her wrist, she spins the gun deftly on her index finger. 
"So why call this Sacred Lake? These Filthoids and Phantasms don't really scream holy."]],
          DialogueId = 6200106,
          GUID = "0F8574E4",
          NextDialogue = 6200107,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcName = "StoryEvent11_Char01",
          Subtitle = [[
"I have lots of energy to spare! You're the one who's lugging around that massive sword and shield."
With a flick of her wrist, she spins the gun deftly on her index finger. 
"So why call this Sacred Lake? These Filthoids and Phantasms don't really scream holy."]]
        },
        [6200107] = {
          ContentEN = [[
"Watch your words, Cathy."
The male Caron Priest grips his staff firmly.
"The Sacred Lake remains hallowed ground where the chosen receive divine grace. Though darkness now taints it, we of Elysium must still keep reverence in our hearts."]],
          DialogueId = 6200107,
          GUID = "0F85750E",
          NextDialogue = 6200108,
          RougeTalkActorType = 1,
          SpeakNpcName = "StoryEvent11_Char03",
          Subtitle = [[
"Watch your words, Cathy."
The male Caron Priest grips his staff firmly.
"The Sacred Lake remains hallowed ground where the chosen receive divine grace. Though darkness now taints it, we of Elysium must still keep reverence in our hearts."]]
        },
        [6200108] = {
          ContentEN = "The fourth member — a cloaked female Sorceress with a longbow strapped to her back — gives a dismissive chuckle at his words. Her black hood shadows her face, hiding any expression.",
          DialogueId = 6200108,
          GUID = "0F857538",
          NextDialogue = 6200109,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "The fourth member — a cloaked female Sorceress with a longbow strapped to her back — gives a dismissive chuckle at his words. Her black hood shadows her face, hiding any expression."
        },
        [6200109] = {
          ContentEN = "The young captain opens his mouth to defuse the tension, but no words come. Just as he struggles for a solution, his gaze lands on you.",
          DialogueId = 6200109,
          GUID = "0F857562",
          NextDialogue = 6200110,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
