          Subtitle = "(Wells, like a child who's misbehaved, stands with his head bowed in front of an old man, allowing the latter's finger to jab at him.)"
        },
        [51001906] = {
          ContentEN = "Shut up! You have no talent, yet you try to be a Phoxhunter. Do you really think you deserve this money and fame? Running around like a dog for others. The inner city now sees the Wells family as a joke!",
