          Subtitle = "The tree says... blossom."
        },
        [51127316] = {
          ContentEN = "Blossom... yes. A tree lives long, yet its flowering is brief — that's why every eye is drawn to it. People are the same: pulled by unseen seasons, and then — they bloom, sudden and bright. Even Lord Argent would pause to marvel.",
