          NextDialogue = 80120443,
          SpeakNpcId = 93301,
          Subtitle = "I was so mad when I ran out that I didn't even pay attention to remembering the way! So after I said goodbye to Plumpytail, I got lost... And I just kept walking, feeling more and more tired, until I fell asleep in the snow...",
